{
  "title": "AFTERIMAGE//PULSE V2: THRONE//VOLT pad",
  "bpm": 136,
  "beatSeconds": 0.441176,
  "key": "E major",
  "transpose": 0,
  "swing": 0.5,
  "seed": 2362,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "image",
      "bars": 4,
      "development": "The hook on THRONE//VOLT, dark and close: closed pickups, held notes that open; the music box behind it; kick and bass from bar 3; a hand-drum answer.",
      "startBeat": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "pulse",
      "bars": 8,
      "development": "Eight bars of 2-step that never repeat a bar. The hook talks; the bass answers each held note with its own phrase, then in bars 9-11 pulls against the hook in dotted eighths and drags the kick off the downbeat until bar 12 realigns.",
      "startBeat": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "glitch",
      "bars": 4,
      "development": "E minor: Am, B7, Cmaj7#11, D7. Voice and bass split the melody (pickups/held notes), swap, become leader and afterimage, converge in octaves; three sixteenths of silence; the cry.",
      "startBeat": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "afterimage",
      "bars": 4,
      "development": "As V1: no drums, a heartbeat, the hook at half speed in the choir, the music box at tempo; the sink into C major and the bloom.",
      "startBeat": 64
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff",
      "bars": 8,
      "development": "The lift to A; a rising descant against the falling hook; the hook over the tonic; the bass finishes the answer; the 5-sixteenth cascade climbs across the bar lines over a falling bass and lands on a downbeat; D# -> E; the music box replays the opening image.",
      "startBeat": 80
    }
  ],
